[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/httpie/cli/issues/comments/577702532","html_url":"https://github.com/httpie/cli/issues/840#issuecomment-577702532","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/httpie/cli/issues/840","id":577702532,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU3NzcwMjUzMg==","user":{"login":"jkbrzt","id":326885,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjg4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/326885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt","html_url":"https://github.com/jkbrzt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-01-23T14:23:10Z","updated_at":"2020-01-23T14:24:19Z","body":"@AxelVoitier thanks for the report.  \r\n\r\nThe reason why it fails on AppVeyor is that when you invoke HTTPie from that script, then HTTPie’s stdin is redirected. And redirected stdin is not compatible with extra request data specified on the CLI. It’s easy to reproduce it with:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\necho 'file data'  > file.txt\r\necho 'stdin data' | http --form httpbin.org/post foo@file.txt\r\n\r\nhttp: error: ValueError: Data must not be a string.\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe solution is to include `--ignore-stdin` in the command (see https://httpie.org/doc#scripting for more details):\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n$ echo 'ignored stdin data' | http --ignore-stdin --form httpbin.org/post foo@file.txt\r\n```\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe bug here is that HTTPie doesn't fail with the following error as it does when you try to send some non-form-file data with redirected stdin on top of that:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n$ echo 'stdin data' | http --form httpbin.org/post foo@file.txt data=data\r\n\r\nhttp: error: Request body (from stdin or a file) and request data (key=value) cannot be mixed. \r\n             Pass --ignore-stdin to let key/value take priority.\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/httpie/cli/issues/comments/577702532/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jkbrzt","id":326885,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjg4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/326885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt","html_url":"https://github.com/jkbrzt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkbrzt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2973910376,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50Mjk3MzkxMDM3Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/httpie/cli/issues/events/2973910376","actor":{"login":"AxelVoitier","id":284119,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NDExOQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/284119?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AxelVoitier","html_url":"https://github.com